  <participating-org role="4" type="24">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">YCC is a registered non-governmental organization and officially recognized by Ministry of Interior on October 14, 2002. And to comply with the new law on civil society organization, the YCC re-registered on December 13, 2016. The YCC&#x2019;s goals is to coordinate themechanisms for youth participation in improving the sectors of socio-economic right, democracy and governance reform, natural resource management, quality of education, public finance management reform and business development, leadership and policy development, and international peaceful relationship and cooperation. Truly, YCC&#x2019;s values are teamwork building, participation, transparency, accountability, mutual respect, individual and collective responsibility, honesty and high morality and joininterest focus. Our value reflects our organization and what we believe. And the identity of YCC is a youth premier NGO which is none political and non-religious. Therefore, YCC always works with all stakeholders based on its values, statutes and the lawon civil society organizations. YCC main program is to strengthen youth leadership and civic engagement through capacity-building initiatives, advocacy, and partnershipsthat promote social inclusion, good governance, and sustainable development.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Youth Council of Cambodia</narrative>
